Description: "Proposal: use-case ValueSet 'Quantitative (all numeric)' for the analyte protein urine (Quantitative-scale measurements PLUS generic measurement-property concepts without an asserted scale. All numeric/measured results, including ratios and fractions.). Candidate pool = `<< 363787002 |Observable entity (observable entity)| : << 246093002 |Component (attribute)| = 88878007 |Protein (substance)|, << 704327008 |Direct site (attribute)| = << 122575003 |Urine specimen (specimen)|` against the LOINC Ontology 2026-10-21. 13 concepts (13 with LOINC, enumerated at LOINC 2.83). Classification of the pool by Scale type and Property; the rule is stated above."
